OL,3,ATrump faces backlash after saying he
OL,4,A'convinced' Nvidia to reinstate CEO
OL,5,AJensen Huang
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia has reinstated CEO Jensen Huang
OL,8,Fjust days after rejecting his offer to
OL,9,Freturn to the AI chipmaker - and less
OL,10,Fthan two weeks after he was forced to
OL,11,Fresign over a reported affair with a
OL,12,Fsuspected Chinese spy.
OL,14,FThe company came under pressure by
OL,15,FDonald Trump to reappoint Huang - and
OL,16,Fon Monday, the US president said he
OL,17,F"made the deal" to "convince" the tech
OL,18,Fgiant's board to bring him back.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
