OL,3,ATrump faces backlash after saying he
OL,4,A'convinced' Nvidia to reinstate CEO
OL,5,AJensen Huang
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut now both Trump and Nvidia are
OL,8,Ffacing bipartisan backlash from
OL,9,Flawmakers, just as Huang is due to
OL,10,Ftestify before Congress next week.
OL,12,FThe CEO's comeback helped end a
OL,13,Fweek-long losing streak in US stocks
OL,14,Fthat left the S&P 500 in correction
OL,15,Fterritory, and added nearly $1 trillion
OL,16,Fto Nvidia's market value.
